      "mergeID": "5ca29cac7fea7a7d6d396a78",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I recently had a friend have a seizure while playing the game. The whole thing was recorded and put on YouTube. Everyone around the guy was supportive but there was 1 issue. They didn't have any way to get help. I think there needs to be a button in the game for someone to report a person that they are having a medical emergency. It should then blank out everything the person who is having the Seizure see's so that the seizure is not yet again triggered. You should have a small group of people who are able to work and assess the situation. The button should have a Red Cross on it. Hopefully this will make our community a safer place and use this idea to save lives!",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Medical / Seizure Report Button",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5ae041ade1c31f5815306835",
